    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1648">

                <pb facs="1047" n="931" xml:id="pg931"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 511.4A1/1480.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Delegate Van Dyke to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">The Hague</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-06-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 20, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Germany and Portugal decline to put the Convention into effect until Turkey,
                    Greece and Serbia come in; Great Britain will wait for Germany. Yesterday’s
                    meeting adjourned till Monday. May we agree to put the Convention into effect
                    with a limited number of Powers?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Van Dyke</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
